Package: ConcominantDrugFeasibility
Type: Package
Title: Feasibility of Concomitant Drug Analysis in Prostate Cancer Patients
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andrei", "Kiselev", email = "kiselev.eco@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Assesses, in an OMOP CDM database, how many patients of a prostate
    cancer cohort (PCa ARPI) also have a concomitant drug cohort entry (losartan,
    amlodipine, nifedipine, apixaban, warfarin, atorvastatin, simvastatin). Reports
    the overlap of each drug cohort with the prostate cancer cohort, the
    difference between the drug and prostate cancer cohort index dates in
    10-day bins, and one plot of these bins per drug. Designed for federated
    network use with small cell count censoring.
License: Apache License 2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
